# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# setup: benchpast
# Bench asks for the corner: the grip is drawn, and a drag inwards
# shrinks the frame while Bench keeps its least size behind it.
# Bench opens under the global bar with its tab in reach: it moves by
# the tab, and its grip lies two pixels in from the corner.
wait 60
click 980 30
wait 10
menu-pick Device Tools
wait 10
menu-pick TikuBench
wait 500
expect-title Bench
expect-window-at 15 21
note the grip: dark then light hairline, two pixels in from the corner
expect-pixel 970 666 cbcbcb
expect-pixel 970 667 ffffff
note dragged inwards by the grip: the window keeps its least size, and the
note desk shows where the window was
press 980 668
wait 4
move 940 630
wait 4
move 800 500
wait 4
move 700 440
wait 4
release 700 440
wait 30
expect-same-as-redraw
expect-pixel 900 600 336698
note and by the tab, now that the bar is not over it
drag-window Bench 200 100
wait 8
expect-window-at 170 90
quit
